  "title": {
    "zh": "闸门联锁横渡",
    "en": "Interlocking Sluice Crossing"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "逃脱 · 双向追逐和改道",
    "en": "Escape · Two pursuers and alternate gates"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "两台追击机云母、铃铛都盯着芽芽。瓷轮轮守闸口。两件货中的一件会在三次调闸中换位两次。收齐 2 件标记货物，带到标出的出口。避开 3 台追击或巡线的对手；同格或相向换位都会被拦下。首张地图限 34 回合，复测限 21 回合。 第 4, 8, 12 回合结束时切换通道并转移未取的货物；占用的门当次保持开启。从容模式须用同一程序通过两张地图。 控制台的 A、B 调度表列出两局地形、货物、机器人起点和调闸坐标。 巡线表 cycle 从第 0 回合起依次循环。追击机每回合向芽芽上回合的位置走一步；最短路线并列时按上、右、下、左选。",
    "en": "Mica and Bell both chase Sprout. Porcelain patrols the locks. One of the two loads moves twice across the three gate changes if still unclaimed. Recover all 2 marked items and reach the marked exit. Avoid 3 chasing or patrolling rivals. Sharing a tile or swapping positions with one ends the run. The first map allows 34 turns and the second allows 21. After turns 4, 8, 12, gates change and unclaimed cargo is transferred. Occupied gates stay open for that shift. In Relaxed mode, win both maps with the same program. The A and B schedule cards include both maps, cargo, rival starts and gate coordinates. Patrol cycles start at turn 0. Chasers step toward your previous position, breaking shortest-path ties up, right, down, left."
  },
